flowchart LR
  CORE[Core / orchestrator] --> POLICY[Permission and policy boundary]
  POLICY --> ADAPTER[Connector adapter]
  ADAPTER --> SECRET[Scoped secret provider]
  ADAPTER --> EXT[External service]
  EXT --> ADAPTER
  ADAPTER --> NORMAL[Normalize + provenance]
  NORMAL --> CORE
  AUDIT[Redacted audit] -. records .-> POLICY
  REVOKE[Revocation / expiry] -. control .-> SECRET
